<title>SOUTH KOREA: TABLE-Hyundai Pipe H1 net profit jumps.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Hyundai Pipe H1 net profit jumps.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>(in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)		   207     vs	  35</p>
<p>    Net			  3.11     vs	0.35</p>
<p>    Turnover		 264.48     vs    235.14</p>
<p>Note - Hyundai Pipe Co Ltd, an affiliate of the Hyundai Group, is a leading steel pipe manufacturer. The Korea Listed Companies Association provided the figures but gave no details.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5647</p>
